# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MuhafizSRE: Autonomous Incident Guardian
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Built for the Kaggle AI Agents: Intensive Vibe Coding Capstone Project
# Track 2: Agents for Business
#
# This project demonstrates:
#   1. Multi-Agent System using Google Agent Development Kit (ADK)
#   2. Model Context Protocol (MCP) Server for telemetry ingestion
#   3. Agent Skills for remediation actions
#   4. Security features (SHA-256 hash-chained audit ledger)
#   5. Cloud Run deployability (Dockerfile + cloudbuild.yaml)
#   6. Recovery verification (post-incident health check)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

